.TP
\fB\-\-client\-id\fR \fICLIENT_ID\fR
See the plugin documentation.
.TP
\fB\-\-client\-secret\-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
Read OAuth2 client secret from PATH (or the file named by $CHECK_OAUTH2_CLIENT_SECRET_FILE)
.TP
\fB\-\-scope\fR \fISCOPE\fR
See the plugin documentation. May be given more than once.
.TP
\fB\-\-ca\-file\fR \fIPATH\fR
PEM CA bundle (default: the bundled Mozilla CA store or $SSL_CERT_FILE)
.TP
\fB\-\-insecure\fR
